# Fixture for differential additive-page shadow memory.
#
# Geometry "G" is a 1 x 1 x 2 mesh => 2 spatial bins.
# Quantity Energy has one differential EKIN axis with 4 bins, so the page has
# 2 * 4 = 8 flat bins.  Energy normally has no kind-level postprocess scratch,
# but differential additive pages are divided by differential bin width in
# postprocess, so the snapshot shadow must allocate one data array:
#   Energy(EKIN) -> 8 * 8 * 1 = 64 accumulator bytes
# Expected: accum_bytes = 64, shadow_bytes = 64, npages = 1.

Geometry Mesh
    Name G
    X -1.0   1.0     1
    Y -1.0   1.0     1
    Z  0.0  10.0     2

Output
    Filename est_diff_energy.dat
    Fileformat TEXT
    Geo G
    Quantity Energy
    Diff1 0 100 4
    Diff1Type EKIN
